r.alafasy/5788.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":31,"globalNumber":5789,"arabic":"وَفَٰكِهَةًۭ وَأَبًّۭا","translation":"And fruit and grass -","transliteration":"Wa faki hataw-wa abba.","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5789.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":32,"globalNumber":5790,"arabic":"مَّتَٰعًۭا لَّكُمْ وَلِأَنْعَٰمِكُمْ","translation":"[As] enjoyment for you and your grazing livestock.","transliteration":"Mata'al-lakum wa li-an'amikum.","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5790.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":33,"globalNumber":5791,"arabic":"فَإِذَا جَآءَتِ ٱلصَّآخَّةُ","translation":"But when there comes the Deafening Blast","transliteration":"Faiza jaa-atis saakhah.","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5791.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":34,"globalNumber":5792,"arabic":"يَوْمَ يَفِرُّ ٱلْمَرْءُ مِنْ أَخِيهِ","translation":"On the Day a man will flee from his brother","transliteration":"Yauma yafir-rul mar-u min akheeh","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5792.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":35,"globalNumber":5793,"arabic":"وَأُمِّهِۦ وَأَبِيهِ","translation":"And his mother and his father","transliteration":"Wa ummihee wa abeeh","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5793.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":36,"globalNumber":5794,"arabic":"وَصَٰحِبَتِهِۦ وَبَنِيهِ","translation":"And his wife and his children,","transliteration":"Wa sahi batihee wa baneeh.","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5794.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":37,"globalNumber":5795,"arabic":"لِكُلِّ ٱمْرِئٍۢ مِّنْهُمْ يَوْمَئِذٍۢ شَأْنٌۭ يُغْنِيهِ","translation":"For every man, that Day, will be a matter adequate for him.","transliteration":"Likul limri-im-minuhm yaumaa-izin shaa nuy-yughneeh","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5795.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":38,"globalNumber":5796,"arabic":"وُجُوهٌۭ يَوْمَئِذٍۢ مُّسْفِرَةٌۭ","translation":"[Som